database). I damage equals one point eight eight trillion dollars (reconstruction cost estimates from forty-seven active

38
00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:53.780
conflicts). H casualties equals two point four five trillion dollars (two hundred forty-five thousand deaths per year total

39
00:04:53.780 --> 00:05:04.300
