94
00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.780
You pay extra because the construction workers keep getting shot at.

95
00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:31.990
This is what economists call a "conflict premium" and what normal people call "insane.".

96
00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:42.300
Economic Disruption: The Ripple Effect. Wars stop trade. Global commerce is a fragile thing, like a very large soufflé that

97
00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:48.220
