00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:28.900
Every dollar the government spends creates more than a dollar of economic activity.

122
00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:35.780
This is called a "multiplier." Here are yours: Military spending: zero point six.

123
00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:41.460
(Bombs do not buy groceries.) Infrastructure: one point six.

124
00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:51.020
