125
00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:56.300
(Alive people spend money.) Lost G.D.P. Growth Calculation.

126
00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:04.100
The math is simple. Money spent on bombs grows the economy a little (the bomb factory employs people, who buy sandwiches).

127
00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:10.780
Money spent on anything else grows it a lot more. By choosing bombs, you choose to be poorer.

128
00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:19.100
Deliberately. Every year. On purpose. You are the only species that has figured out compound interest and then decided to

129
00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:24.440
compound losses instead. We lose two point seven trillion dollars in growth.

130
00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:32.140
Every year. Forever. Long-term Human Costs: The Gift That Keeps on Taking.

131
00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:39.260
Wars do not end when the shooting stops. They linger like a house guest who broke your furniture, traumatized your children,

132
00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:44.600
