142
00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:50.760
Your grandchildren will still be paying for Iraq. Refugee Support: The Mathematics of Making People Leave.

143
00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:57.980
108.4 million displaced people. That is roughly the population of Germany, except these people do not have Germany.

144
00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:05.040
One thousand three hundred eighty-four dollars per year per person just to keep them alive in tents.

145
00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:12.599
That is one hundred fifty point zero billion dollars annually to warehouse the people your wars displaced.

146
00:17:13.859 --> 00:17:21.420
Each refugee also loses twenty-three thousand four hundred dollars in earning potential annually, adding another two point

147
00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:30.660
five trillion dollars in lost G.D.P. These are doctors, engineers, teachers, and farmers who are now professionally employed

148
00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:37.100
at standing in line for water. Environmental Degradation: Poisoning the House You Live In.

149
00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:43.760
Wars poison the planet. Explosions, it turns out, are not good for the environment.

150
00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:50.250
This should not require saying, and yet here we are, saying it, because you keep acting surprised.

