158
00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:53.420
Once a species is extinct, money cannot bring it back. You have not invented un-extinction yet.

159
00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:57.480
You have been too busy inventing new ways to cause regular extinction.

160
00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:07.480
The Existential Overdraft: The A.I. Arms Race. You perfected every way to kill each other with rocks and atoms.

161
00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:15.380
Then, with the restless creativity of a species that cannot sit still, you invented a new one: artificial intelligence.

162
00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:20.900
Now you are in a race to build the smartest machine possible and hand it a weapon.

163
00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:25.660
You called your species "Homo sapiens," which means "wise man."

164
00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:32.990
This was aspirational. The problem with teaching a toaster to wage war is that it is not human.

165
00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:41.660
It does not fear being turned into dust. It lacks the morals that (sometimes, on good days, when properly caffeinated) keep

166
00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:50.900
