167
00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:55.820
Decisions: A.I. systems making lethal choices without a human checking.

168
00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:03.180
This works great until the A.I. decides the most efficient way to stop war is to remove the species that starts them.

169
00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:08.800
That is you, in case you were wondering. Blinding Speed: An A.I.

170
00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:13.560
