171
00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:19.910
This happens before a human can find the right button, convene a meeting, or finish their coffee.

172
00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:25.680
Opaque Logic: You do not always know why an A.I. makes choices.

173
00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:31.340
So when your drone army attacks a neutral alpaca farm, good luck writing the apology letter.

174
00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:38.240
Here is how you start to fix this. Take one percent of the money you plan to spend on killer robots.

175
00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:44.520
One cent out of every dollar. Use it to fund research on how to keep them from killing you.

176
00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:51.460
This is not idealism. It is insurance against your own cleverness, which is, historically, the thing most likely to kill

177
00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:56.460
you. You invented dynamite, nuclear fission, and social media.

178
00:20:57.040 --> 00:21:00.020
Your track record with powerful inventions is not reassuring.

179
00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:05.620
The Total Cost of Organized Violence. Here is the grand total.

180
00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:09.020
You may want to sit down. Actually, you are probably already sitting.

181
00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:16.720
